{
  "title": "Odd-Prime Visibility for Rank 2 Curves with Rational 2-Torsion",
  "description": "For the 14 rank 2 curves E/Q with N <= 2000 and E(Q)[2] != 0 (where K[2]^{G_Q} != 0), we test odd primes p in {3,5,7,11,13} to find p with K[p]^{G_Q} = 0. Combined with cycle4 (94 curves with K[2]^{G_Q} = 0), this proves Universal Visibility for all 108 rank 2 curves with N <= 2000.",
